' Question: where does a new kind of bot plug in?
' Explained by: ../05-building-blocks.md. Drawn by hand, high level.
@startuml 05-kind-seam
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
[the shell of every kind\n(runner, store, use cases)] as SH
[BotKindCatalog] as C
[GridKind] as GK
[GridExecutorFactory] as GF
[GridKindBacktester] as GB
[a second kind\n(EPIC-040G)] as K2
[BacktestWorkbench] as W
[RunBacktestQueryHandler] as Q
SH --> C : IBotKindCatalog.kind(kind_id)
C --> GK : IBotKind
C ..> K2 : IBotKind (Planned)
GK --> GF : executor_factory()
GK --> GB : backtester() -> IKindBacktester
W --> Q : RunBacktestQuery(kind_id, request)
Q --> C : kind(kind_id).backtester()
W --> C : kind(kind_id), the kind's editor
@enduml
